/11)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A que horas come\u00e7am as provas da Meia Maratona dos Descobrimentos 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No domingo, 29 de novembro de 2026, o programa inicia-se com a Kids Race (08:45 at\u00e9 aos 6 anos, 08:50 dos 7 aos 9 anos e 08:55 dos 10 aos 12 anos), seguida da Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 09:15, da Meia Maratona de 21 km \u00e0s 10:00 (com vagas \u00e0s 10:00, 10:05 e 10:10) e da Caminhada de 4 km \u00e0s 10:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o local de partida e chegada em Bel\u00e9m?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as dist\u00e2ncias t\u00eam partida na Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio, em Bel\u00e9m (Lisboa), e a linha de meta instalada junto ao Museu da Marinha.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o abertas por fases: na Meia Maratona (21 km) os valores s\u00e3o de 22,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 08\/06), 25,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 07\/09), 28,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 04\/10), 32,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 02\/11), 40,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 20\/11) e 55,00 \u20ac na \u00faltima hora (ou 110,00 \u20ac no pacote VIP at\u00e9 02\/11); na Corrida de 10 km variam entre 12,00 \u20ac e 23,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 20\/11 (35,00 \u20ac na \u00faltima hora); na Caminhada de 4 km entre 9,00 \u20ac e 20,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 20\/11 (25,00 \u20ac na \u00faltima hora); e na Kids Race (500 m) entre 5,00 \u20ac e 8,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 20\/11 (10,00 \u20ac na \u00faltima hora).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento do kit de participante?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do dorsal e kit realiza-se exclusivamente na loja Decathlon Amadora na quinta-feira (26 de novembro, das 15:00 \u00e0s 20:00), sexta-feira (27 de novembro, das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00) e s\u00e1bado (28 de novembro, das 10:00 \u00e0s 18:00). N\u00e3o existe entrega de dorsais no dia da prova (exceto inscri\u00e7\u00f5es VIP 21 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica e promo\u00e7\u00e3o da Meia Maratona dos Descobrimentos est\u00e3o a cargo da Xistarca.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona dos Descobrimentos 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio (Bel\u00e9m)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\", \"streetAddress\": \"Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio (Bel\u00e9m)\"}}, \"description\": \"A Meia Maratona e Corrida dos Descobrimentos 2026 realiza-se a 29 de novembro em Bel\u00e9m, Lisboa. Percursos planos de 21 km, 10 km e 4 km. Garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-descobrimentos-2.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona (21 km)\", \"price\": \"40.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/meiamaratonadosdescobrimentos.com\/\", \"validFrom\": \"2026-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida (